window.products.push({"id":744088,"name":"2 Pcs Silicone Spatula Slotted Cooking Spoon, Non-Slip Handle BPA Free, Non Stick and High Heat Resistant Kitchen Utensils for Baking, Cooking, Frying","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UcXcGDlwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Material】: Our silicone cooking spoon and spatula set are made of flexible food-grade silicone, BPA free, no need to worry about melting or deforming. Spatula is heat resistant with silicone rubber grip, you can protect your hands from being scalded. What's more, the soft silicone head won't scratch the coated & non-stick finish on cookware, bakeware and electrics and can also protect your pots and pans while cooking. 【Unique Idea】Our PETHOMKIT kitchen utensils handle surface have a hold point design, location prompts you correct cooking posture, labor-saving and comfortable, making the stir-frying more easy and smooth. Silicone spatula can also be placed on the side of the pot without worrying about slipping into the pot, greatly free your hands and enjoy cook. The non stick silicone spatula spoon set unique idea can solve your concern, it will be a pleasant shopping experience. 【Ergonomic Design】: 2 Pack large slotted silicone spatula spoon handle long enough to keep the perfect distance between hand and heat source with ergonomic design. Silicone material is very light and can be easily used whether you are new in the kitchen or a professional chef. Cooking utensils has flexible edges design is also fit for silent cooking, which greatly enhances the kitchen experience and provides support for kitchen work. 【Widely Used】: The no stick silicone spatula can be used to turn fish and eggs, fry steak, hamburgers, nice big pancakes, grilled cheese sandwiches, stir-fry and a ton of other flipping uses. In addition, the cooking slotted spoon can be used to gain various food, such as flour, soup, salad, etc. It will be the best kitchen helper. Good kitchen cookware is essential for cooking. 【Easy to Clean and Store】：This non stick silicone wok spatula and cooking spoon are easy to clean and maintain, either by hand or dishwasher. After each use, just rub it with hot water or put it in the dishwasher. Besides, each silicone spatula spoon set handle has a hole for hanging in the kitchen, no stick spatula spoon design can save space and easy to dry. 【Perfect Thoughtful Kitchen Utensils Gifts】: PETHOMKIT slotted spoon silicone spatula wok set comes with a beautiful gift box. They will be the most thoughtful cookware sets gift for mom, friends, co-workers, chefs, on Christmas, Thanksgiving or Birthdays. We have three different colors, black, blue and gray, different colors can be well matched with different shades of kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UcXcGDlwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PETHOMKIT","source_asin":"B0BGLQCN7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGLQCN7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGLQCN7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
