window.products.push({"id":744118,"name":"CAROMIO Halloween Pillow Covers 18x18 Inch Set of 4 Throw Pillow Case Red Velvet Cushion Covers Tombstone Skull Crow Decorative Pillow Covers for Farm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uF7Ivm9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😈【Package Include】Each package includes 4 packs Halloween pillow covers with single-sided printing. These pillow cases measure 18 x 18 inch (about 45x45 cm), a perfect size to put on sofa, couch or bed. ONLY PILLOW CASES, NO FILLER IS INCLUDED! 😈【Home Decoration】There are 4 different designs on these Halloween pillow covers. The one side of them is individually printed with Halloween elements, such as skull, crow, candle, which is a wonderful blend of creepy and pretty, giving you 4 kinds of decorative styles. The other side is blank, on which you can add any decoration you like. 😈【Premium Material】These Pillow Cases are made of durable and smooth velvet, soft and comfy to touch. The fabric edges are sewn well to prevent fray and ensure durability. Completely machine washable, do not use bleach. 😈【Wide Application】These velvet pillow cases can be widely used on sofa, chair, couch, car, bed, office, providing a good holiday atmosphere for Halloween. Made of high-quality velvet and with cute designs, it is also a wonderful gift for family and friends. 😈【Invisible Zippers】 These decorative throw pillow covers are equipped with a hidden and smooth zipper, making it easy to insert or remove the pillow without affecting the aesthetics. Encrypted sewing at the zipper, not easy to tear, which can be used more durably.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uF7Ivm9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAROMIO","source_asin":"B0972RX1KM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0972RX1KM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0972RX1KM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":744119,"name":"Recliner Chair Cover Stretch Suede Merlot 733","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xbv0Iw1fL._AC_.jpg","description":"Stretch Recliner cover is made in standard size to fit the most popular types of recliners, such as La-Z-Boy and Lane and Strato-Lounger chairs. Fits most standard recliners with a right-side handle. Features side pocket for remote control or TV guide. Stretch fabric clings tightly to the contours of your furniture and looks really great. Offers lush and soft feeling of suede with out the high price. Unbelievably similar to real suede, but a lot easier to care for. Memory stretch form fitting fabric is washable and pet friendly. 90% poly, 10% spandex.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xbv0Iw1fL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SlipcoverShop","source_asin":"B00C77OW9O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C77OW9O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C77OW9O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":744120,"name":"Chicago Cutlery Forum 7-Inch Santoku Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61baflBKyRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Chicago Cutlery Forum 7-Inch Santoku Knife includes 1-Each 7-Inch Santoku knife.Chicago Cutlery Forum collection is constructed of high-carbon stainless steel blades and features our exclusive Taper Grind edge technology which is extremely sharp and enables precision cutting. The forged bolster provides balance and safety while ergonomically designed stainless steel handles combine comfort and safety with sleek, contemporary styling. Amazon.com This seven-inch santoku knife combines the precision of a Western chefs knife and the power of a Chinese cleaver. Its an essential in most Japanese homes as well as many professional kitchens. Great for chopping and dicing herbs or vegetables, the broad, straight blade also produces razor-thin and precise slices of sashimi, or any other fish, meat, or poultry. Oval-shaped indentations on each side reduce friction for a cleaner cut and help release food so that it falls away from the blade. Chicago Cutlerys new Forum line appeals to those who want to combine value, performance, and the sleek contemporary appearance of a seamless all-stainless design. Made from heavy-duty high-carbon stainless steel for rust and stain resistance, they feature forged blades for a leap in quality above cheaper stamped knives, yet cost much less than famous-name German knives. Chicagos exclusive Taper Grind edge is razor-sharp and cuts with precision; these knives will need to be re-sharpened on a regular basis, but they take an edge beautifully and with maintenance can stay out-of-the-box sharp for years to come. The full tang extends from one end of the knife to the other for a superbly-balanced feel and added strength, while the heavy-duty forged bolster enhances safety. Ergonomically-designed stainless steel handles feel comfortable in the hand. They join seamlessly to the blade for an elegant high-tech look that enhances contemporary kitchen décor even as it provides few places for food and bacteria to hide. Chicago Cutlery covers their knives with a lifetime guarantee; they recommend hand-washing and drying for best results. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61baflBKyRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chicago Cutlery","source_asin":"B00091SDK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00091SDK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00091SDK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":744121,"name":"HoMedics WRF-REL EnviraScape Illuminated Rainforest Fountain with 6 Natural Sounds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H79FPJ2TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Model: WRF-REL. Relaxation Fountains & Sound Machine in One. The Soothing Sound of Rain: Adjust rainfall from a gentle shower to a dramatic downpour. 6 Natural Sounds - Helps to relax your spirits and mask distractions: Rain Forest. Thunder. Summer Night. Sunrise. Loons. Wind Chimes. Continuously changing colors - Illuminates fountain in shades of blue, red and yellow. Relaxation Fountain and Sound Machine in One: Escape from the stress of the moment as illuminated rain showers create a unique visual display and stress-free ambiance. Clear your mind as the six soothing sounds slowly melt away tension and provide the perfect backdrop for sleep, relaxation and concentration. EnviraScape Rain Forest Fountains bring these vital benefits while their creative designs add beauty and tranquility to any indoor environment. Transport your self to an oasis of serenity - where your own nature is rested, renewed and refreshed. Adjustable Rainfall: Choose from a gentle shower to a dramatic downpour. Six Natural Sounds: Six custom recorded natural sounds mask distractions so you can stay focused. Innovative, Artistic Design: Enhances the environment at home or at work. Continuously Changing Colors: Illuminates fountain in red, blue and yellow for a more dramatic effect. Durable Electrical Water Pump: Can be operated from any indoor electrical outlet. Easy to Assemble: Assembles in minutes with simple, illustrated instructions. Convenient Tabletop Size: Fountain Measures 7-inches Long x 5.75-inches Wide x 13.25-inches High. At HoMedics, we believe that nothing is more important than your health. From America's number one selling massages to revolutionary ideas in home healthcare technology, HoMedics creates products with your well-being and budget in mind. Due to continuous product improvements, the picture on the carton may differ slightly from the actual product. This product employs a UL Listed adaptor. 1 Year Limited Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H79FPJ2TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homedics","source_asin":"B0000AR6XG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000AR6XG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000AR6XG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
