window.products.push({"id":744138,"name":"Names To Remember My Greatest Hero Poem Personalized Father's/Dad Day Gift on Coast Guard Art w/Dual Matte Border","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712KTJU8FcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This makes a Perfect Gift for Father / Dad... Tell Him HE is Your HERO! Poem Reads : \"Dad My Greatest Hero This world has many heroes, some you’d know by name. They give their best at what they do, so they deserve their fame. But among all of the heroes this world has ever had, There is not one admired more than the guy that I call Dad. Perhaps not like the others, he doesn't look for praise. He’s heroic in his special way, in his thoughtful caring ways. Perhaps he’s not as famous as the others that you see. But he’s everything and so much more that heroes ought to be. He keeps his word, it’s good as gold, on this you can depend. He’s honest and he’s loyal too, he’s also a true friend. When I hear about a hero, and the great things they have done, It reminds me of my father, he is the greatest one... Amen\" and comes Matted in a Beautiful Biscay Blue and Baltic Blue Dual Matte Border with Backing... It is Perfect for Framing ... WILL NEED A FRAME that Holds Any 11\" X 14\" Matted Picture/Photo, Preferably One with Bend Out Tabs On Back since The Matte is High Quality....","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712KTJU8FcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Names To Remember","source_asin":"B00ZZ3KLKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZZ3KLKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZZ3KLKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
