window.products.push({"id":744276,"name":"VASG 40000mAh Camping Fan Battery Powered with LED Lights Rechargeable Remote Control Auto Oscillating Tent Fan with 4 Speeds, Portable Power Bank for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nfSq+VGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-IN-1 40000mAh Battery Operated Fan】Built-in a rechargeable Extra-large Capacity Battery, this sturdy outdoor fan features Super Endurance with longer working time than other battery fans in the market, working from 15 up to 136 hours after a full charge(9-10h). A must-have camping accessories for outdoors activities, picnic, barbecue, fishing, car travel in summer, etc., as Cooling fan, Camping Lights and Power Bank. 【4-Speed Adjustment with Auto-oscillation】14 INCH high, 4 speed settings: Soft Wind, Cool Wind, Strong Wind and Extra-strong Wind with more powerful air flow and effiecent cooling. Featuring 45° or 90°auto-oscillation, up to 270°head rotation and 360°hook rotation, the wind direction can be flexibly and automatically adjusted, to serve multiple person in a range up to 16.4ft. 【3 Light Brightness & 5 Light Modes】Consisted of 32 LED BEADS, the lamps have 3-level brightnesses (150LM, 400LM, 500LM) and 3 kinds of light colors (White Light, Warm Light, and White & Warm Light). 5 Light Modes for your choice to create different light atmosphere in camping tent. Also, it can work as an indoor emergency lighting during a power cut in bedroom, dorm room, office etc.. 【Indoor/Outdoor Emergency Power Bank】Equipped with a Type-C input/output and a Type-A output port, it can charge your Mobile Phone, Laptop, Tablet, Bluetooth Headset, Humidifier, Mini audio or other supported devices when you travel out. Note: if the power bank doesn't work when charges a phone, please press the Sleep Mode button to activate it. 【Remote Control & Sleep Mode & Timer 】Equipped with a Remote(battery included), you can operate it conveniently within a range of 16.4ft. (NOTE: Remove the insulation sheet inside the remote at the first use.) Sleep Mode and Timer functions make it Sleeping Friendly indoor and outdoor. All indicator lights turn OFF in Sleep Mode, and the Timer enables it to turn off automatically in 1H/2H/4H/8H. You do Not have to wake up at mid-night to turn it off manually. 【3 Ways to Set】Stand, Hang, Wall-mounted.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nfSq+VGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VASG","source_asin":"B0C4GBDRJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4GBDRJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4GBDRJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
