window.products.push({"id":744342,"name":"Flash Furniture Roxbury Twin Size Tufted Upholstered Platform Bed in Black Fabric with Memory Foam Mattress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":510.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I9X0T4SvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you're moving into your first apartment or home or you are ready to revamp your existing sleep space, this low profile twin sized platform bed and mattress in a box set is the perfect place to start. Classic design never goes out of style. The outlined headboard features the understated look of button tufted upholstery that will always be in fashion. Platform beds are designed to give your room an open concept feel and are perfect for those who don't like high seated beds. This hybrid twin mattress, offering pocket spring support with luxurious memory foam layering, will give you the firmness you need with the softness you crave. The foam is CertiPUR-US Certified so it's free from heavy metals, phthalates, BPDE, formaldehyde and has reduced VOCs so you can rest easy knowing the air quality in your home won't be compromised. This 12\" memory foam pocket spring mattress sits atop 15 wooden support slats and provides superior motion isolation while supporting the contours of your body. The interior make-up has pocket spring coils and foam. Once you cut the plastic the mattress will start to expand and will return to its original shape within 48 to 72 hours. The casual style of this platform bed provides just enough character to blend seamlessly into your design scheme.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I9X0T4SvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B0BCRC81DH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCRC81DH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCRC81DH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
