window.products.push({"id":744359,"name":"Aviano Premium Bamboo Cooling Weighted Blanket for Adults - 15 lbs (Taupe Gray) for Queen Size Bed (60x80 in.) - Heavy Blankets for Restlessness","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QKRTGIIdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience a Better Night’s Sleep - After a long day, you need to unwind so that is why Aviano 15 lb weighted blankets could help with sleep restlessness. The cooling blanket for hot sleepers gives you a very calming feeling of being hugged or cuddled since they are made with non-toxic micro-glass beads that will help reduce tossing and turning throughout the night. Our Heavy blanket could help with relaxation, temperature or control for better sleep. Premium Weighted Blanket Queen Size - Aviano Bamboo weighted blankets for adults is expertly designed & crafted with 100% natural soft Eco-Friendly bamboo fabric sizing 60x80 inch. Aviano washable weighted blanket should be cleaned in machine wash cold water by gentle speed, dry clean; we suggest you hand wash it in cold water and air dry. Our weighted blanket cooling material and weight could help you relax, sleep better and stay cool while making you fall asleep faster. Choose the Right Size & Weight -Unsure of what weight blanket to choose? We recommend selecting a weight around 7-12% of your body weight. Aviano weighted blanket 15 lbs is ideal for Body Weight ranging from 120-170 lbs. Choosing the right size is essential to enjoy all the benefits that the weighted throw blanket provides. Our tranquility weighted blanket is perfectly sized for maximum coverage laying across your lap while enjoying activities such as TV, reading or whenever you want to cuddle. Non-Leaking Technology - Aviano weighted cooling blanket is made to perfection since it uses 7-layer programmed sewing methods to prevent the beads from leaking out. Each cooling blanket features unique square shaped Smaller (4\"x4\") pockets with millions of premium micro glass beads to help keep the weight evenly distributed on you. Our bamboo blanket is expertly balanced which can help you sleep well and enhance feelings of calm relaxation, wakefulness and serenity. Excellent Service - We ensure that our queen weighted blanket will meet your expectations and offer returns without questions asked. If you have any issues with our soft weighted blanket simply reach out to us via your order's page, and we promise to make things right","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QKRTGIIdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aviano","source_asin":"B08X9GX618","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X9GX618","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X9GX618","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
