window.products.push({"id":744526,"name":"Küchenprofi Stainless Steel Cooking Rings, Set of 4 Forming Ring Molds, 2.5 Inches and 3 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aYwUEd-EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful, delicious homemade food is more important than ever. When it’s time to share your food with friends and loved ones, whether around the table or through pictures online, there is no better way to create perfectly molded, shaped, or layered appetizers, entrees, and desserts than with Küchenprofi’s Stainless Steel Cooking Rings. This premium quality set of stainless steel forming rings makes it easy to shape beautiful cakes, mousses, cookies, salads, tarts, and even mini cheesecakes in a snap. This set includes two 2.5-inch rings and two 3-inch rings. This high end set of kitchen tools is not only easy to use but also easy to clean—all pieces are completely dishwasher safe.For home cooks who demand the highest quality kitchen tools and utensils, Küchenprofi is here to help. If you’ve been looking for professional grade equipment to use at home, they have you covered. Founded in Germany in 1923, Küchenprofi produces superior quality cooking and kitchen accessories. The products in their extensive collection are manufactured to the highest standards and feature expert craftsmanship and timeless design. Frieling has partnered with this brand since 2017 and proudly brings its quality stainless steel cooking tools, household gadgets, coffee mills, cutting boards, graters, and other food preparation accessories to the US market. Frieling does not just sell products; they offer solutions by partnering only with the best brands in the industry. This is why Küchenprofi is one of their brands of distinction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aYwUEd-EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Küchenprofi","source_asin":"B07XYP6BWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XYP6BWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XYP6BWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
