window.products.push({"id":744622,"name":"Window Toppers Stephanie Country Style Ruffle 3 Piece Swag Curtains Set 132 Inch W by 45 Inch L - 3 Inch Rod Pocket, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lzCld1NXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Stephanie Country Ruffle 3 Piece Swags & Filler Valance Curtain Sets can be ordered in a choice of 2 color fabrics and 45, 54 & 63 inch lengths. Each 3 piece set includes one pair of ruffled swags + one matching filler valance (as pictured). These charming country ruffled swag curtain sets are adorned with 5 1/2 inch wide country ruffles and can be ordered with a choice of 1 1/2 inch or 3 inch rod pocket (Product is pictured with a 3 inch rod pocket). One 132 inch wide swag curtains set will accommodate approximately 30 - 45 inches of window width, and can easily be adapted to accommodate wider window widths by adding/purchasing additional filler valances (add/purchase one additional filler valance for every 15-20 inches of added window width as needed) to place between the swags. Length measurement is measured from the top stitch line of the rod pocket to the bottom edge/longest point of the curtain. Width is measured Overall, 132 inches wide per 3 piece set including ruffle for all 3 pieces together. Fabric is 70% polyester/30% cotton for easy care, machine washable. Sold as a set, 3 pieces. Picture shows one 3 piece set. *Coordinating Ruffled Privacy Tiers are available and sold separately in our Amazon storefront. We also offer coordinating Ruffled Priscillas with Bow Tie Backs and choice of 3 Valances, which are all sold separately. Made in the USA !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lzCld1NXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Window Toppers","source_asin":"B0073FN6BU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0073FN6BU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0073FN6BU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":744623,"name":"Blackout Curtains for Bedroom - Thermal Insulated with Grommet, Soft Touch, Privacy Protect, Room Darkening Drapes 2 Panels W52 x L63(Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PXmE54VTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GOOD TO KNOW Type: Grommet Top Design Curtain Contain: 2Pcs/Pack  Size: W52*L63in/ W52*L84in  Color: 5 Color Material: 100%Polyester Technology: Triple Weave Blackout Curtain: Crafted with a triple layer fabric, these panels blocks out all of the unwanted light and UV for a sounder, more uninterrupted sleep. The darker the color the better the light reducing capabilities. Provide Privacy: The thick curtains provide privacy by preventing outside from seeing into the room. Anti-rust Grommet Rings: The reversible grommet style lets you easily hang your curtains from either side without hassle. Reversible Design: With the right pattern and fabric, they have the power to completely switch up a room’s aesthetic. Energy Saving: These thermal curtains create an energy-saving barrier against heat and cold, keeping room cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter. Help saving your energy bills. Noise Control: Blackout curtains are able to filter approximately 20% -30%of the outside noise from entering in the room. Laser Trimmed Hems: Machine cut hems ensures that your panels are of even lengths and no loose threads for a beautiful overall look. Machine Washable: No bleaching.Tumble dry.Low ironing. Note: Due to differences in computer monitor displays, variations in color may occur between the actual product and what is shown on your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PXmE54VTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr.Ding","source_asin":"B07CZXLSPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZXLSPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CZXLSPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
