window.products.push({"id":744633,"name":"TSPROF - K03 Pro Hunter Sharpening Kit, Knife Sharpener, Knife Sharpening Kit for All Types of Knives and Tools, Knife Sharpening Device with Stones, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":900.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rzboIYs3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Restore dull knives with the TSPROF system! Equipped with a rotary mechanism and rigid construction, this device sharpens at precision angles. So, you can sharpen knives in no time. Delivers Reliability, Efficiency and High Precision Our revolutionary knife sharpening system combines modern technology with precision engineering. With its advanced features, razor sharp knife sharpener gives you a hassle-free sharpening experience any time. Works Well with Any Clamp from the KO3 Sharpening System No need to buy new clamps every time. The TSPROF Kadet Pro frame works with any clamps from the K03 sharping systems. This includes the fillet, single, classic double clamp and even a small universal table for sharpening tools. Includes 5 Diamond Plates with Different Grain Sizes This pro sharpening kit already includes 5 diamond plates of different grit sizes. Instead of using small sharpening steel, use these: Extra Coarse (≈F150) - For roughing of the edge and forming the shape of the blade Coarse (≈F220) - For forming the knife’s cutting edge Medium (≈F400) - For the main sharpening and creating the aggressive/biting cut Fine (≈F600) - For pre-finishing the cutting edge and removing visible marks Extra Fine (≈F1000) - For finishing the cutting edgeTrusted by Knife Professionals TSPROF produces advanced knife sharping systems for personal and industrial use. Various cutlery experts, chefs and blacksmiths recommend the quality, efficiency and precision of our sharpening device. Keep your knives razor sharp with TSPROF!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rzboIYs3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TSPROF","source_asin":"B0B52JYF4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B52JYF4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B52JYF4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
