window.products.push({"id":744739,"name":"Better For Your His & Hers Coffee Mugs Stainless Steel Double Wall - Set of 2 Mugs - Freestyle Font","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bPRGyWCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- The Story Of Our Innovative New Handle For over 20 years, stainless steel mugs have had basic, round handles. This served the purpose, however many people found these handles less comfortable than the wider, oval handles found on ceramic mugs.We listened to our customers and embarked on a mission to design a Better handle.This presented some challenges! The older-style round stainless steel bends easily, whereas oval stainless steel is much trickier to work with. But improved oval handles was the goal, because our customers deserve the best.We spent countless hours researching, developing and refining “The Art Of The Oval Handle” so we are pleased and excited that it’s now here for you to enjoy.Not only does it feel great in your hands, there’s increased finger room to improve comfort. It’s inspired by a traditional handle feel, combined with the stylish, durable, 18/8 Stainless Steel body that makes our mugs perfect for the home and outdoors We’ve had these new oval handle mugs road-tested by hundreds of RVers, campers and adventurers. They loved how the handle feels, that the handle does not get hot, the stylish exterior and the unbreakable design. Better For Your Mugs are perfect for: - Coffee, tea, beer, smoothies, milkshakes, iced tea, juice, spirits even ice cream or as a unique snack-server! - Your home: ready when you are for your morning coffee or during the day when you can sit back and relax - Gifting to friends and family: They will love this stylish and practical mug. Our clean, eco-friendly packaging also makes a great first impression. - RVing, Camping, Hiking: Lightweight and unbreakable so you won’t have to replace any more broken ceramic mugs. - At work: Your mug will stand out from the others and is easy to wash. - Boating & Sailing: This will be the new star(board) attraction on deck!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bPRGyWCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better For Your","source_asin":"B07K7YHQRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K7YHQRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K7YHQRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
