window.products.push({"id":744802,"name":"Resealable Standup Mylar Bags for Food Storage, Valentine cookies –Resealable Bags for Small Business, Weddings, Preppers & More – Matte Gold, 10x7in,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J0M9vbOnL._AC_.jpg","description":"☘️️ THIN MYLAR VACUUM SEAL BAGS often come with WEAK SEALS that AREN’T ODOR-PROOF, a sure sign that they AREN’T AIRTIGHT either! That’s why we made our BluePerlOne Reusable Mylar Food Storage Bags with EXTRA THICK (5MIL), MULTILAYER MYLAR and an EASY-TO-USE SEALING STRIP that creates an AIRTIGHT, ODOR-PROOF SEAL – no heat required (unless you prefer it!). Our large mylar bags are perfect for preservation packing anywhere. ☘️ MADE WITH STRONG, PUNCTURE-PROOF mylar that can WITHSTAND HIGH TEMPERATURES AND PRESSURE, our myler bags CAN BE FOLDED AND TWISTED as much as you want, making them great for prepping or shipping. With DOUBLE-SIDED LAMINATION & a matte gold design, our mylar RESEALABLE bags are not only aesthetic but BLOCK OUT LIGHT, UV, XRAY, MOISTURE, and odor to keep your items secure. ☘️ PRESERVE YOUR FOOD – Our reusable bags help PROLONG THE SHELF LIFE of dried and fresh foods. Add our food packaging bags to your EMERGENCY PREPPER’S checklist or use our mylar bags STAND-UP design for DIY MEAL READY-TO-EAT BAGS. With the help of some oxygen absorbers, your food will remain preserved until you need it most! (Oxygen absorbers not included.) ☘️ OUR 10\" X 7\", 5MIL, 50 COUNT mylar bag resealable set will look GREAT DECORATED with YOUR OWN CUSTOM LABELS, making them the perfect option for SMALL BUSINESSES, DIYers, PARTY AND WEDDING favors, and more. EASY TO FILL, our scent-proof bags can also be stocked away to KEEP EXTRA RATIONS should the unthinkable happen. However you use your mylar packaging, our reusable snack bags are designed for life! ☘️ AT BLUEPERLONE, WE’RE HERE TO PROVIDE you with INTELLIGENTLY DESIGNED mylar smell proof BAGS made WITH QUALITY, REUSABLE MATERIALS that help REPLACE SINGLE-USE PLASTIC BAGS. Whether you use our stand up pouches to represent your business or for survival food storage, WE HOPE YOU LOVE them! Please reach out to us if you have any comments or questions. ☘️ MRE (MEAL READY-TO-EAT) AND MULTI-USE BAG - These pouches are great containers for storing, shipping samples, keep samples during shelf lie studies, or for sampling. Great to pack small gifts. Smell proof, airtight odor-free ziplock bags ☘️ BPA FREE, AIRTIGHT & EASILY SEALABLE STAND-UP & RESEALABLE - These stand-up mylar ziplock bags can stand up by themselves, Easy to fill. Resealable ziplock bags have a sealing strip help to work with various heat sealer machines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J0M9vbOnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BluePerlOne","source_asin":"B092PDTY45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-744802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092PDTY45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092PDTY45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
